OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine, although a few
OL,7,Fshowers may continue throughout the
OL,8,Fmorning towards Devon and Cornwall.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average with light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOvernight see some patchy
OL,13,Fcloud and most clear spells, with the
OL,14,Fodd shower in Cornwall. A cool night
OL,15,Fand comfortable night across the
OL,16,Fregion.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
