OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAny showers in the west, will
OL,6,Ffade as cloud lifts and breaks,
OL,7,Fleaving a dry and sunny day for all.
OL,8,FSunshine may be hazy at times. Feeling
OL,9,Fwarm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA dry
OL,12,Fstart to the weekend, with sunny
OL,13,Fspells the odd shower by Sunday.
OL,14,FTurning warm on Saturday, but
OL,15,Ftemperatures will slowly decrease into
OL,16,Fnext week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
